### CATEGORY API TEST
@host = http://localhost:8080
@categoryId = 1

### ==========================================
### C1 - GET ALL CATEGORIES
### ==========================================
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### C2 - GET CATEGORY BY ID
### ==========================================
GET {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### C3 - CREATE CATEGORY
### ==========================================
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Category",
  "description": "Category created for API testing"
}


### ==========================================
### C4 - UPDATE CATEGORY
### ==========================================
PUT {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Category",
  "description": "Category updated for API testing"
}


### ==========================================
### C5 - DELETE CATEGORY
### Chỉ chạy nếu danh mục không có sản phẩm
### ==========================================
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### C6 - GET PRODUCTS BY CATEGORY
### ==========================================
GET {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}/products
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### N3 - CATEGORY STATISTICS
### ==========================================
GET {{host}}/api/categories/stats
Accept: application/json